title: "Prescribing coefficients of invariant irreducible polynomials over finite fields: counterexamples, corrected formulas, and complete restoration"
abstract: >-
  Audit of G. Kapetanakis, "Prescribing coefficients of invariant irreducible polynomials",
  J. Number Theory 180 (2017) 615-628: counterexamples to several statements, corrected
  formulas, complete statements and proofs without exceptional pairs, with the verification
  program and its data.
